## 3. User Story

**Title**: Market Intelligence Chatbot for Brand Strategists

**As a** brand strategist or marketing manager,
**I want** to input my brand and automatically discover my top competitors,
**So that** I don't have to spend hours manually researching who my digital rivals are.

**As a** user,
**I want** the system to automatically scrape web presence, news, and social media data for my brand and my rivals,
**So that** I have a centralized, up-to-date knowledge base of the market landscape.

**As a** user,
**I want** to chat with an AI consultant that has access to this specific scraped data,
**So that** I can ask precise questions about competitor pricing, recent social media engagement, and market positioning without leaving the application.

